{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "learning-golden-signals",
  "title": "Четыре золотых сигнала",
  "tags": [
    "learning",
    "prometheus",
    "sre"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-5m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Доступность HTTP: Blackbox",
      "description": "Проверка независима от счётчика ответов приложения: 1 — доступно, 0 — проверка не прошла.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Нет",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Да",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "probe_success{job=\"web-http\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Prometheus собирает метрики web",
      "description": "Показывает успешность сбора экспортёра, а не успешность ответов приложения.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Нет",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Да",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"web-metrics\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "1. Задержка HTTP: p95",
      "description": "Приблизительный 95-й процентиль по завершённым запросам. Разделены маршруты и классы 2xx/5xx; 30 секунд — учебное окно rate.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service, route, status_class) (rate(lab_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{status_class=~\"2xx|5xx\"}[30s]))) and on (service, route, status_class) (sum by (service, route, status_class) (rate(lab_http_requests_total{status_class=~\"2xx|5xx\"}[30s])) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} / {{route}} / {{status_class}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "2. Трафик: HTTP-запросов в секунду",
      "description": "Скорость завершённых ответов Nginx, включая фоновую нагрузку и проверки Blackbox, но не опросы экспортёра.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(lab_http_requests_total[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "3. Ошибки: доля ответов 5xx",
      "description": "5xx среди всех завершённых HTTP-ответов. Если запросы не доходят до выключенного приложения, эту ситуацию показывает Blackbox выше.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum by (service) (rate(lab_http_requests_total{status_class=\"5xx\"}[30s])) / sum by (service) (rate(lab_http_requests_total[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "4. Насыщение: CPU от лимита",
      "description": "Использованное контейнером CPU-время, делённое на лимит CPU из cgroup. Включает Nginx и учебный экспортёр.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum by (service) (rate(lab_container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[30s])) / sum by (service) (lab_container_cpu_limit_cores)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "4. Насыщение: память от лимита",
      "description": "Занятая память cgroup, включая файловый кэш и tmpfs, относительно лимита. Это не только память процесса Nginx.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum by (service) (lab_container_memory_usage_bytes) / sum by (service) (lab_container_memory_limit_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Сценарии для терминала",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "```bash\n./demo.sh slow web-1 30\n./demo.sh traffic web-1 30\n./demo.sh errors web-2 30\n./demo.sh cpu web-1 30\n./demo.sh memory web-2 30\ndocker compose stop web-1\ndocker compose start web-1\n```\nПосле запуска сценария дождись нескольких сборов метрик. Насыщение CPU/RAM — индикатор использования ограниченного ресурса, не доказательство узкого места."
      }
    }
  ]
}
